        <briefdescription>
<para>If possible, pre-allocate <computeroutput>ExtraSize</computeroutput> bytes for stream data. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>i.e. it extends internal buffers to keep additional ExtraSize bytes. So that the stream could keep at least <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__ostream_1a0f90ad570f71349466844ee9f2d06cd1" kindref="member">tell()</ref> + ExtraSize bytes without re-allocations. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__svector__ostream_1a94bec39d1b2d114ce2a7f131314c2254" kindref="member">reserveExtraSpace()</ref> does not change the size/data of the stream. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
